      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While muscle cramps are possible, sharp, worsening pain combined with breathing difficulty requires professional assessment because DVT can mimic less serious issues. Taking high doses of aspirin without medical advice can also promote bleeding, which is dangerous if you have a clot. Please prioritize your health and call your primary care physician right away to describe your symptoms and get advice on whether an urgent visit is necessary.",
      "source": "target",
